opics touched?\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Evaluate whether the contribution is substantial enough for EMNLP main.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XXmhHbXsfJXAi38jwBK3FN","session_id":"c37caaf9-7598-4fc8-9bcc-d45cab0964b7","uuid":"cab0c42b-9e41-4c83-8ef3-80438d8d8cf6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:39:20.080Z"}
