{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014RrnAm7cvDwuCccwsikav4","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 faith-evidence-ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (74 个)\\n\\n- **mvp2_sft_eval_r2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_sft_eval**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_extract_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r4**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_extract**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_flatnli**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r3**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_r1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **precompute_nli_train**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_sft_warmup**: DONE (success) — \\n- **smoke_test_grpo**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp1_ced_signal**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| mvp2_rsft_ced_scoring_topk3_r2 | CED scoring ablation: top_k=3 (vs top_k=1). More training data (~8000 samples) vs stricter selection (2718 samples). Retry with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 (NLI model cached locally). | — | — | — |\\n| mvp2_rsft_ced_scoring_topk3 | CED scoring ablation: top_k=3 (vs top_k=1). More training data (~8000 samples) vs stricter selection (2718 samples). Answers: does CED filtering strictness affect RSFT training quality? | — | — | — |\\n| mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b_maxtok1536_r2 | Truncation diagnosis: r2b eval with max_new_tokens=1536 (vs default 1024). Retry with correct model stack (Base+SFT+RSFT). If EDCR improves significantly (from 0.6609 toward 0.71+), truncation is the cause. If unchanged, distractor citation is genuine RSFT behavior. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- mvp2_eval_rsft_s44: Full dev eval of RSFT seed=44 checkpoint. First MVP-2 judgement data point. Pass: rel_f1 > 0.4057 AND evi_f1 > 0.798 (SFT baseline).（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **mvp2_rsft_diagnosis** (success): RSFT failure root cause: rel_f1=0.0483 vs SFT 0.4057. Diagnose: training data distribution (relation count), step-170 checkpoint output analysis, SFT vs RSFT data comparison.\\n- **mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_last** (killed): —\\n- **mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r3** (killed): kl_coef=0.01 (vs r5 kl_coef=0.0) prevents CED mode collapse while keeping QLoRA 4-bit compatible — answers whether KL regularization is necessary (retry: fix --lr + bash -c wrapping) ← 基于 mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 21 / 负向 11 / 失败 12 / 共 64\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nrtx5090-4x: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_extract: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_sft_eval: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_r4: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_extract_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r4: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_extract_r4: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r5: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_multi: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_last: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_ckpt90: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_high: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_p1_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_rp_r1: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_ckpt7080: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_rp_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt40: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_lr5e6_rp_r2_ckpt20: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt60: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_rsft_generate: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp2_rsft_train_r2_fix: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp2_eval_rsft_\\n\\n## 研究想法\\n# Idea Inbox\\n\\n## 待验证\\n\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 A**：增大 KL 系数（0.001→0.04）+ 扩大 LoRA rank（r=4→r=16）+ 降低 lr 至 1e-6。文献调研表明 GRPO+QLoRA 低秩+低KL 是已知不稳定组合，这是最低成本的修复。\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 B**：分层 Reward 设计——将单一 reward 分解为 format_reward + entity_reward + relation_reward，消除 reward hacking 捷径。参考 RL-Struct (arXiv 2512.00319) 的层级约束方法。\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 C**：集成 Qwen 团队的 Online Merging Optimizer (arXiv 2405.17931)，在 GRPO 每步将 LoRA 更新方向锚定在 SFT 附近，训练中在线缓解 alignment tax。\\n## ACTIVE\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XXmhHbXsfJXAi38jwBK3FN","session_id":"c37caaf9-7598-4fc8-9bcc-d45cab0964b7","uuid":"0a57ebab-5c4d-4ec1-9787-351d41aad69b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:39:33.887Z"}
